    <item>
      <title>Welcome &amp; About</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 19:17:06 -0600</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;why-even&#34;&gt;Why Even?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I want to blog, even if the medium has been thoroughly commodified. Expressing yourself online without a concern for image or money is almost unheard of nowadays, but I need this space to get some thoughts out of my head. The dangers of over-journaling are evident. It&amp;rsquo;s unhealthy to have so many thoughts alone; it&amp;rsquo;ll drive a man mad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So this space is part idea board, part diary, part sanity check, part manifesto canvas, and part whatever else. Just a brief glimpse into my dark and twisted mind as I scream myself hoarse into the void of a billion faceless text boxes.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
